# Build artifacts
app/libs/*.aar
app/libs/*.jar
core/mobile/*.aar
# ...except the gomobile core, which is a deliberately tracked prebuilt input. It is
# regenerated by android/build-core.sh; tracking it (not ignoring it) makes changes to
# the compiled Go core surface in `git status` instead of silently diverging.
!app/libs/libtunnelbahn.aar

